[{"client_msg_id":"88d53796-07cf-4c57-a575-ad1ee886eb5a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/tsuyoshicho/.github\u003e\n一応、共通のと各リポジトリ固有(優先)は共存できた気がしますが、ちゃんと試したことないなあ","ts":"1631746965.073900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jj="}]},{"client_msg_id":"e269d756-8615-48d6-a292-46b1f3472e34","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ほとんどの人は作るリポジトリの種類偏ると思うけどな。一方で 1 種類のみと言うのも相当レアなはず","ts":"1631724944.073000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q/Fd1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1bb84fa2-09a6-4ad5-aadf-cdd3eb371e5e","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"特定ジャンルのプロダクトを量産する個人という想定がないのか","ts":"1631724668.072400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vo7L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34ff793d-299a-48dd-9bb5-72126a88bf65","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Vim プラグインと Go モジュールと npm パッケージと gem パッケージと…ってそれぞれで org 作るんか??? みたいになるので解決策用意してほしいなぁ","ts":"1631724128.071900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jOGj4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f714867-5e3f-4576-8331-0bdf2a22421c","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"lestrrat-go方式","ts":"1631724062.071100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KQjR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e91ca6ed-f8cc-4ff3-b760-55fb37e42802","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"今後の GitHub に期待したい… (しかしそういう場合は org 作れって言われたら終わる :innocent:)","ts":"1631723862.070500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"msRj3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"982ca5ef-4fba-4ee0-aacc-98178c5e6a03","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"となるとやはり現状だと org 作るくらいしか解決策がない…","ts":"1631723814.069700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"op3b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66966605-a810-4105-8401-5b2369ba6530","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"(FUNDING.ymlは分けたいとかないので助かっている)","ts":"1631723801.069500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZS8N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f517c11c-a1c3-426e-870f-e79fc18a2b5e","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"一応リポジトリごとの上書きはできますが複数用意するのはできないので面倒そう","ts":"1631723759.068500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fV4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e9268d3-c3de-40e5-9418-e8e73dcc0ce6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"理想は「このリポジトリはこのテンプレート群を使う」みたいに個別に参照できるようになることですねぇ。Vim プラグインのリポジトリのバグレポートテンプレートには Vim のバージョン等を書いてほしいが、そうでないリポジトリにはこの項目は含めたくないわけなので","ts":"1631723739.068100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/EO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd2678a2-0a26-4071-80d0-2f6bbb132fa9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"いつのまに…","ts":"1631723617.066600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D9x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79da2c8b-d9a2-451c-82c4-69d46684e69e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あと、テンプレートはリポジトリの種類ごとに分けたいと言う問題がそもそもあったりします… Vim プラグインとそれ以外のあれやこれと","ts":"1631723593.066400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SkNA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5626749-fab4-4c32-81eb-b29297d9eaa5","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"\u0026gt; もともとこの機能はOrganization(個人アカウントではない)のみで動いていたと思いますが、いつのまにか個人アカウントでも.githubリポジトリが機能するようになっていました。","ts":"1631723590.066300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CwDAA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66ea8b44-2171-4905-b896-1aa4937c346a","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"\u003chttps://efcl.info/2021/09/04/github-meta-repository/\u003e","ts":"1631723578.065800","attachments":[{"fallback":"Web Scratch: user/.githubリポジトリを使い、FUNDING.ymlやCODE_OF_CONDUCT.mdなどを一括設定する","id":1,"title":"user/.githubリポジトリを使い、FUNDING.ymlやCODE_OF_CONDUCT.mdなどを一括設定する","title_link":"https://efcl.info/2021/09/04/github-meta-repository/","text":"GitHubには username/.github というように .github リポジトリというメタファイルを置くリポジトリが作れます。たとえば、 username/.github リポジトリに CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md ファイルを置くと、usernameのすべてのリポジトリにそのファイルが反映されます。","thumb_url":"https://efcl.info/public/favicon.ico","blocks":null,"ts":1630731780,"service_name":"Web Scratch","thumb_width":16,"thumb_height":16,"from_url":"https://efcl.info/2021/09/04/github-meta-repository/","original_url":"https://efcl.info/2021/09/04/github-meta-repository/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vNGF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"190aa57d-dc0c-4ab2-8d00-47f1e2e9ea6d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あれ、本当ですか。以前試した時は動かなかったんですよね","ts":"1631723553.065100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CXf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e63b100f-1814-44ea-97a6-7c53e5e52b6d","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"個人ユーザーも使えますよ","ts":"1631723520.064700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jFYI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ceaa85e-d085-48d4-b2c4-212680aea128","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"\u003chttps://docs.github.com/ja/communities/setting-up-your-project-for-healthy-contributions/creating-a-default-community-health-file\u003e\nこれを使うと 1 つのリポジトリに Issue/PR Templates とかを集約できるので、リポジトリ毎にメンテナンスしなくて便利そうなのだけど、これ org でしか使えないのよなぁ\nVim プラグインのリポジトリの Issue/PR Templates を 1 箇所で管理できると助かるのだけど… `thinca-vim/xxx` みたいな org を作って全部移管するとかしないと無理そうで、さすがにやりたくないな…","ts":"1631723374.064400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"dele